<title>USA: AMEX to list PhyMatrix options on Jan 6.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list PhyMatrix options on Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Monday it would list options on PhyMatrix Corp on January 6.</p>
<p>It said the options will open with strike prices of 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2, with opening expirations in January, February, May and August.</p>
<p>TFM Investment Group will be the specialist unit.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
